  "41bcd1659198a6fd5baa7d39d34c708d9fbda048912b467ba8866b1aceb40506": {
    "cn": "<p>\n              抱歉，您的浏览器暂不支持选择目录，请更换为 Chrome\n              或其他现代浏览器后再试。\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              本功能依赖\n              <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/API/Window/showOpenFilePicker\">showOpenFilePicker API</a>，仅在支持的浏览器中可用。\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              该 API\n              用于授予浏览器写入本地文件夹的权限；若不被支持，项目将无法正常运行。\n            </p>",
    "en": "<p>\n              Sorry, your browser does not support the\n              <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/showOpenFilePicker\">showOpenFilePicker API</a>. Please use Chrome or other modern browsers.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              This feature depends on the showOpenFilePicker API, which is only\n              available in supported browsers.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              The API is used to grant the browser permission to write to local\n              folders; without it, the project may not function properly.\n            </p>"
